vice at 36 St","description":"[shuttle bus icon] Free Q96 buses run between Court Sq-23 St and 21 St-Queensbridge, stopping at Queens Plaza.\n\nTravel alternatives:\nFor 14 St, 23 St, 34 St-Penn Station, 42 St-Port Authority and 50 St, take the [A] or use nearby [F] stations along 6 Av.\n\nFor 7 Av, take the [D] instead.\n\nFor 5 Av/53 St, use nearby [F] stations at 57 St or 47-50 Sts.\n\nFor Lexington Av/53 St, use the nearby Lexington Av/59 St [N]  station.\n\nFor Court Sq-23 St, take the [7].\n\nFor Queens Plaza, take a Manhattan-bound [E] via transfer at Steinway St, use the nearby Queensboro Plaza [accessibility icon] | [7][N] station or take [shuttle bus icon] free shuttle buses.\n\nTransfer stations:\nW 4 St-Wash Sq [accessibility icon] | [A][E][D][F]\n34 St-Herald Sq [accessibility icon] | Jamaica Center-bound [E], [D][F][N]\n42 St-Port Authority/Times Sq/Bryant Park\n[7][A][E][D][F][N]\n47-50 Sts-Rockefeller Ctr [accessibility icon] | Jamaica Center-bound [E], [D][F]\n21 St-Queensbridge [accessibility icon] | Jamaica Center-bound [E], [F] [shuttle bus icon]\nQueens Plaza [accessibility icon] | Manhattan-bound [E] and [shuttle bus icon]\nSteinway St [E][F]\nJackson Hts-Roosevelt Av/74 St-Broadway [accessibility icon] | [7][E][F]\nWhat's happening?\nTrack maintenance\n\n[accessibility icon] This service change affects one or more ADA accessible stations and these travel alternatives may not be fully accessible. Please contact 511 to plan your trip.","periods":[{"start":1791344700,"end":1791363600},{"start":1791431100,"end":1791450000},{"start":1791517500,"end":1791536400}],"createdAt":1788528743,"updatedAt":1791304376},{"id":"lmm:planned_work:33366","type":"Station Notice","planned":true,"priority":3,"header":"Enter 5 Av/53 St [E][F] Station at 5 Av only\nMadison Av entrance will be exit only","description":"What's happening?\nWe're replacing escalators","periods":[{"start":1776333600,"end":1806908771}],"createdAt":1784303199,"updatedAt":1784303262},{"id":"lm